{"name":"Love Spell","hex":"#f8b4c4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"love","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A deep caring for the existence of another.","Strong affection."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To have a strong affection for (someone or something).","To need, thrive on."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/love"},{"term":"spell","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Words or a formula supposed to have magical powers. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A magical effect or influence induced by an incantation or formula."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put under the influence of a spell; to affect by a spell; to bewitch; to fascinate; to charm.","To hanker or yearn (for something)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/spell"}],"entries":[{"title":"Love magic","blocks":[{"text":"Love magic is a type of magic that has existed or currently exists in many cultures around the world as a part of folk beliefs, both by clergy and laity of nearly every religion. Historically, it is attested on cuneiform tablets from Mesopotamia, in ancient Egyptian texts and later Coptic texts, in the Greco-Roman world, in Syriac texts, in the European Middle Ages and early modern period, and among all Jewish groups who co-existed with these groups."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Der_Liebeszauber_by_Niederrheinischer_Meister.jpg/330px-Der_Liebeszauber_by_Niederrheinischer_Meister.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_magic","wikidata":"Q1061157"},{"title":"Love Spells","blocks":[{"text":"Sir Taegen C'aion Harris, also known as Love Spells, is an American musician and singer-songwriter from Houston, Texas. He gained popularity in 2025 with his EP The Love I Showed You Was Yours To Keep and was featured on over half of the tracks on Kevin Abstract's 2025 album Blush. In 2026, he released his debut studio album, Love Is the Law."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Spells","wikidata":"Q140700544"},{"title":"Love Spell","blocks":[{"text":"Love Spell is a Philippine fantasy and romance-based program airing on ABS-CBN that tells a different love story each season with a new couple. It was aired from July 9, 2006, to March 23, 2008."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/14/Lovespelllogo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Spell","wikidata":"Q12967395"},{"title":"Love","blocks":[{"text":"Love encompasses a range of strong and positive emotional and mental states, from the most sublime virtue or good habit, the deepest interpersonal affection, to the simplest pleasure. An example of this range of meanings is that the love of a mother differs from the love of a spouse, which differs from the love for food. Most commonly, love refers to a feeling of strong attraction and emotional attachment."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love","wikidata":"Q316"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG/500px-1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG/1280px-1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG/500px-1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Roman love spell, by Johann Erdmann Hummel, 1848","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A1848_Hummel_Liebeszauber_anagoria.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a3/Lscindyrella.jpg/250px-Lsci